cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HELIX in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "HELIX: sensor-integrity monitoring and independent stop verification for the Unitree GO2"
abstract: "Observe-only ROS 2 monitor for the Unitree GO2. Detects content faults that
  rate and range checks miss (frozen payloads, stalled stamps, cross-sensor gyro
  residual between body IMU and LiDAR IMU) and verifies commanded stops from
  independent raw-sensor evidence instead of trusting the state estimator. Evaluated
  in a pre-registered held-out study on real GO2 recordings with injected faults."
